            "detailed_description": "<h1>New game released</h1><p>[/url]</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>[b]Blameless[/b] is a 3D adventure focused on puzzle solving and story. Set in an unfinished house, the player is trying to escape a mysterious man. While you know how and why you got there, you could not foresee you were invited for a twisted purpose and it’s upto you to investigate what happened and how to get out. \n\nThis is a short, yet full title with an open ending. Take around [b]20 to 60 minutes[/b] to complete. \n\n[h2]Blameless Is Free[/h2]\nBlameless is dedicated to the community! \n\n[h2]Gameplay Features[/h2]\n[b]Realistic[/b] puzzle solving \n[b]Investigative [/b]approach \n[b]Mysterious [/b]atmosphere \n[b]Alternative [/b]puzzle solutions \nStory progression via [b]exploration [/b]\nCharacter [b]voice over[/b]\nElement of [b]tension[/b</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><strong>Blameless</strong> is a 3D adventure focused on puzzle solving and story. Set in an unfinished house, the player is trying to escape a mysterious man. While you know how and why you got there, you could not foresee you were invited for a twisted purpose and it’s upto you to investigate what happened and how to get out. <br><br>This is a short, yet full title with an open ending. Take around <strong>20 to 60 minutes</strong> to complete.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blameless Is Free</h2>Blameless is dedicated to the community!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><strong>Realistic</strong> puzzle solving <br><strong>Investigative </strong>approach <br><strong>Mysterious </strong>atmosphere <br><strong>Alternative </strong>puzzle solutions <br>Story progression via <strong>exploration </strong><br>Character <strong>voice over</strong><br>Element of <strong>tension</strong>",
